      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FULL TWIST (1) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Finished third (20.14) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Leading chance again. LOLLIPOP VALLEY (8) is going better than form suggests, finishing in the placings two back then missed the frame last time but not beaten far when a 1.75 lengths fourth (20.42) in a Grade 5 at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. NUGGET ROBERTS (3) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, two back missing the frame but last time hitting the line hard to place when third (17.36) in a Grade 5 at Casino last time. Form here at the trip sound including 12 wins. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Can feature again. LOCAL LEGEND (4) form at this course and distance reads well.",
